{
  "api_version": "v6.0",
  "name": "addmm_",
  "requires_triton_kernel": true,
  "description": "Representative ATen schema: aten::addmm_(Tensor(a!) self, Tensor mat1, Tensor mat2, *, Scalar beta=1, Scalar alpha=1) -> Tensor(a!). Preserves legacy matrix shapes, floating dtypes, scalar alpha/beta coverage, and column-major benchmark cases. Tests verify in-place mutation, Python return identity, and storage preservation.",
